{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "8af75fe1c410052b1d54dba7ff6d8cf0d73e7a930020ca786c80255fbad91d16", "ja": "シトラス・ストロベリー・オレンジ♪", "zh": "柑橘、草莓、柳橙♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0411a6575ea61b3718ca2c847c2608153e10e2dd277af65f925f3bd58dac90a0", "ja": "仕事が成功したご褒美に、スケートへと\n遊びに来た3人。可憐の練習に付き合ったり\nわざと転んで気を引こうとする翼と茜の\n相手をしながら、プロデューサーは\nアイドル達に無限の可能性を感じる。", "zh": "为了奖励三位偶像顺利做好工作，\n制作人与她们一起来溜冰。\n制作人一下陪可怜练习、\n一下应付假装滑倒想引起注意的翼与茜，\n同时也在心中感受到偶像们无限的可能性。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "274150a4a45629c12a1d3b340e4deda89264d42032153e0b140a2c55f78a5152", "ja": "（今日は、『りるきゃん』の仕事が成功した\nご褒美という事で、みんなでスケートに来た）", "zh": "（今天为了奖励偶像们成功完成《莉露甜心》的工作，\n大家一起来溜冰。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8775eb7203cffc068d7d69e75c33cbe45ae5b86eb844cda5416b4f371b6435d6", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん、\n遅いですよ～。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生，\n你好慢喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1002_p", "source_sha256": "73a74b73f404b8cb04c92c589618614fc9eee5537f4694bc6d4d885b18b50e58", "ja": "ごめんごめん。待たせたか？", "zh": "抱歉抱歉，你们等很久了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "e4abdcec05f19afb656e35b6091b0f34faf2147ccb963d2dd341c823393772ed", "ja": "い、いえ……！\n私たちも、来たばかりです……。", "zh": "不、不会……！\n我们也才刚来而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "1d377d126778e5e64768c3f494e70ac80f6a9ec303267202365d2bcb8fd31e58", "ja": "スーパーアイドル茜ちゃんにも、スーパー\n{$P$}ちゃんにも、休みは必要だよ！", "zh": "不管是超级偶像小茜还是\n超级小{$P$}都需要休息喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "8cc1abf2be40b257b47ffec744fa9251566116687090b9d19a9d32f80483d369", "ja": "というワケだから、今日は楽しも！\n{$P$}ちゃん！", "zh": "所以今天就尽情玩乐吧！\n小{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1006_p", "source_sha256": "1e5db86b2cdc7aa3b5e95996f0b6f1549403f305504c0e263d2e1e17a30a0406", "ja": "そうだな！\nけど、なんでスケートになったんだ？", "zh": "说得也是！\n不过，为什么要挑溜冰呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "59e47447d82e0980d25875216160e0bb7d62beb7489ab8d4ec5f5c1299b77746", "ja": "それは、可憐さんがスケート行ったことないって\n言ったから！　強引に連れてきちゃいました♪", "zh": "因为可怜说她没溜过冰！\n所以我们就拉她来了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1008_045kar", "source_sha256": "1763336884f4191e369e6816be6e80feae3b9494ee86b44f1e6bfe73ebd5ecaf", "ja": "そ、そうなんです……。\nなので、す、滑れるかどうか、不安ですけど……。", "zh": "是、是的……\n所以、我、我不知道到底学不学得会，好担心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1009_023aka", "source_sha256": "c4c4d2a6707e97155dd40a372771def7b4d858772449a0f063715fef504e3933", "ja": "氷上の妖精とも呼ばれた茜ちゃんのスケーティングを\n見てるだけでも楽しめるはずだよ、可憐ちゃん！", "zh": "光是欣赏号称冰上妖精的小茜溜冰，\n就值回票价啰，小可怜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1010_045kar", "source_sha256": "606709649e9de10b5ed5032cc394e5aaf7c0212e6c3c65e022093631e45be84c", "ja": "はい……！\n初めてのスケート、楽しみます……！", "zh": "好的……！\n我会享受第一次溜冰的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1011_p", "source_sha256": "a1c44722b0818fa2cbf67d1c5dbafc32e518a49b107747f9193b1043cad4c8b3", "ja": "（スケート靴を履いて……っと。\n茜と翼はもう滑っているみたいだな）", "zh": "（先穿好溜冰鞋……好了。\n看来茜和翼已经在溜了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1012_023aka", "source_sha256": "a2837331eed36a5909e46198ef6cca2a985c8c6d09b2b1a01fe7019ca532534f", "ja": "あー、やっぱり茜ちゃんが注目集めちゃってるかー。\n仕方ないよね。茜ちゃん運動神経バツグンだから！", "zh": "啊──大家果然都在看小茜──\n这也没办法，谁叫小茜运动细胞超群嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "151770987ee1638dcc2c10a80f109b69488c2c11549f15faedeae77918769bcd", "ja": "わっ！　バランスとるの、難しい～！　スケート来るの\n久しぶりだから、滑り方、忘れちゃってるかも～。", "zh": "哇！好难维持平衡喔～！我好久没来溜冰了，\n好像忘记要怎么溜了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1014_p", "source_sha256": "6d95cff1a9353dc45644ed9ecfb4a6f22ba465a25d403ee3b01e95f68fa71084", "ja": "みんな、もう楽しんでるみたいだな！\nところで、可憐は……。", "zh": "她们俩似乎都溜得很开心呢！\n但是，可怜就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1015_045kar", "source_sha256": "c74b42c87cb28b5e9457dbbeb7d7215157885ed6d578ee374e01a0c91f2d081a", "ja": "あうう……{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "啊呜呜……{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1016_p", "source_sha256": "81ec59b943d794e2a4996250fa47de098214dce953dd0002309cc877851d0e15", "ja": "スケート、楽しめてはいないみたいだな……。", "zh": "你似乎无法享受溜冰的乐趣呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1017_045kar", "source_sha256": "bbec41ef6227618caee1fdca804f11b5c1db7f13a0cfc8bf17583b3751702115", "ja": "わ、私……、\n立ってるだけで……こ、怖くて……。", "zh": "我、我……\n我光是站在原地……就、就好害怕……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1018_045kar", "source_sha256": "b0223c7d67846082d2d590f5fb2c840da112de0ef452c1804ea9b8fc40eb301c", "ja": "翼ちゃんと茜ちゃんには、先に行っててって\n言っちゃったんですけど……。", "zh": "我要小翼和小茜她们先去溜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1019_045kar", "source_sha256": "48acf081982b529f1aaa4fbfe595944a7866547d827b7cff994a0088070b36f1", "ja": "ふたりの邪魔をしたら、悪いですから……。", "zh": "因为我怕干扰到她们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1020_p", "source_sha256": "d30fb58a888756822f157ad379b9b8a89b179058118d1a55eb53c406b35b1ae7", "ja": "一緒に遊びに来たんだから、\nそんな事気にしなくてもいいと思うんだけど……。", "zh": "既然大家是一起来玩，\n我觉得你应该不用这么在意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1021_p", "source_sha256": "5a58422a73a738980e0200c23d466e31f9c90c2704a8433aac2093a9df5a23e6", "ja": "じゃあ、俺と一緒に翼と茜に追いつこうか。\nほら、手を貸すから。", "zh": "不然，你和我一起追上翼和茜吧。\n来，我牵着你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1022_045kar", "source_sha256": "ea8d8953128308ef7cbdc6810f98a7a6a138cb63d354180698a3ee91e383b7c7", "ja": "{$P$}さん……、\nは、離さないで……くださいね……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n请、请你不要……放手喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1023_p", "source_sha256": "9c2572d6d611268bf68c6ec400ae24fdc195efddcb4540d42c068662a7590626", "ja": "離したりしないよ。\n手に掴まっていれば、ちゃんと立てるだろ？", "zh": "我不会放手的。\n抓住我的手，应该就能站稳了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1024_045kar", "source_sha256": "1cc31b3f2c937aa565b82e3d7fabce7e3a3e399d308ecd5845545d54f6d8b1b9", "ja": "ご、ごめんなさい……。\nひゃっ！", "zh": "不、不好意思……\n呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1025_se", "source_sha256": "cf47533f456015296ecc73d9f7bb25bd808b43b4de97bbccd34cecf651fc171e", "ja": "ツルッ！", "zh": "（滑溜！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1028_045kar", "source_sha256": "e5665f278c55622f39d930dfd91f233477ab03ce84aecd5d506bfdb3618c7f95", "ja": "{$P$}さん、これって、\nい、いったい、どうすれば……きゃっ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，这样究竟、\n该、该怎么办、才好……呀啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1029_se", "source_sha256": "1f5416e11ff60c4849f401484b341fc9e33d9844eeb378ec0b2357a18b36a920", "ja": "ドシャッ！", "zh": "咚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1030_045kar", "source_sha256": "253dc846af18e98338ae600d5df0e9509caa725159e005c46089aba79410649f", "ja": "あ、あいたたたた……。{$P$}さん、\nす、すみません……あうぅ……。", "zh": "好、好痛……{$P$}先生，\n对、对不起……啊呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1031_p", "source_sha256": "456db3e35091b329ddba0fc6c9158f4bfb4667d38e331580a0796469a3088c2d", "ja": "可憐、大丈夫か？　もっとしっかり掴まっていいぞ。\n俺が引っ張っていってやるからな。", "zh": "可怜，你没事吧？你可以抓紧一点没关系。\n我会拉着你溜的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1032_null", "source_sha256": "5ac08eb49f79e0b5bcbf767202d77a3ecc263cecef3991fb77e8283d709f36cb", "ja": "一方……", "zh": "另一方面……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1033_016tsu", "source_sha256": "ab1786f6ad58116f8ee8e15506cc4db3961c90b7757d4f50a4429ed23a28e98f", "ja": "あれ？　そういえばひとりで滑ってきちゃったけど、\n可憐さん大丈夫だったかな？", "zh": "对了，我只顾着一个人溜冰，\n不知道可怜有没有问题？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1034_016tsu", "source_sha256": "38f84de595f2c894855b70c42b38e7363bddb2926f1f4ffa16660db9de809ce0", "ja": "えっと……あ、いたいた♪　可憐さ……あ～っ！？\n{$P$}さんと腕組んでる～！", "zh": "我看一下……啊，找到了♪可怜……啊～！？\n她跟{$P$}先生勾着手～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1035_016tsu", "source_sha256": "df65b49893f67a2d509e1ad70b5bb58db5c228db059f3d2ae66c29163c8cb406", "ja": "ズルーい！　わたしだって、\n{$P$}さんにつかまりたい～！", "zh": "太心机了～！\n人家也想被{$P$}先生牵着～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1036_p", "source_sha256": "2119e5c3e9ed4225770d38eabd072de6ff8da51a3c5ede9623210c135ee75952", "ja": "翼？　何を騒いでるんだ……あっ！？", "zh": "翼？她在激动什么……啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1037_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f2ce390370dd4cbcbe9bdc5759601aaeccff8c7ccd8ee0f5b7f0cd94b9df3baf", "ja": "{$P$}さ～んっ、\nわたしのことも助けて～！", "zh": "{$P$}先生～！\n你也来帮帮我啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1038_p", "source_sha256": "7b0ebba56e2ea1cdd0cbd6ccd451fa23e89f0ebb208837bcfd9df5079dd57828", "ja": "翼もか……！\n待ってろ、今行くぞ。", "zh": "翼也滑倒了……！\n等一下，我马上过去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1039_p", "source_sha256": "4979b13289a4ae6ae8b21cd0abd9cdfb5e83e12643c6d7659e67af140d4010fd", "ja": "……よいしょっと。\n大丈夫か？　翼。", "zh": "……嘿咻。\n还好吧？翼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1040_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d643960829a2b1b01418bea7ebede50e54ed89df99dfbe9738a48aef52f2329a", "ja": "{$P$}さんが来てくれたから、\n大丈夫ですよ～。えへへ、作戦大成功～♪", "zh": "因为{$P$}先生来帮忙，\n所以我没事了～嘿嘿，作战大成功～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1041_023aka", "source_sha256": "2516f0875ad4f5c67c341e2e9774285623edf950f8c546fb2676c30924706f01", "ja": "むむ……。可憐ちゃん、翼ちゃん、やるね！\nそういうことなら、茜ちゃんも参戦だー！", "zh": "唔唔……小可怜、小翼，算你们厉害！\n既然这样，小茜也要参战了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1042_023aka", "source_sha256": "b16579c9e67cd519d6236b354edfd5e8a91933cfeb472295475eea2236cd18fa", "ja": "茜ちゃんの愛らしい転び方、見るがいいー！\nつるりーん！", "zh": "见识小茜惹人怜爱的滑倒姿势吧──！\n我滑──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1043_p", "source_sha256": "a7f3dcbdf0c85b5efce2e5c6712d290794df82066daa2d72b40d362bb254e4a0", "ja": "茜まで……！\n忙しいな！", "zh": "连茜都滑倒了……！\n这也太忙了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1044_p", "source_sha256": "dec29f9fb878c4313c616ef317bc046a86c5ed74196f071b4e36151cd3262ab8", "ja": "ん？　今気がついたけど、\n3人ともなんだかいい香りがするな。", "zh": "嗯？我现在突然发现，\n你们三个身上都有股香味呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1045_016tsu", "source_sha256": "335aa786b1af27de9f3900c81b56622a4161496645a5858893ee0cc4cb2ab43a", "ja": "あっ、気づいてくれましたか？\nこの前のふろくで作ったリップクリームですよ～♪", "zh": "啊，你发现了吗？\n是之前企划的附录护唇膏喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1046_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3ac34be60015a0baa868848f60eb7c839fb89808ea4ab517a4824f3876f08b42", "ja": "わたしの香りは、『ハニーシトラス』です♪\n茜ちゃんのは、ストロベリーだっけ？", "zh": "我的香味是『蜂蜜柑橘』♪\n小茜的我记得是草莓吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1047_023aka", "source_sha256": "2ab42ce3bb88f4a579f46356f64fc2d2a3d7ffe43d8d05c194e4d57a53af8c51", "ja": "うん！　茜ちゃんのは、『ストロベリーバニラ』だよ！\n茜ちゃんにピッタリだよね！　もちろん愛用してるよ！", "zh": "嗯！小茜的是『草莓香草』喔！\n很适合小茜吧！小茜当然很常用喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1048_045kar", "source_sha256": "86f991c80802bc0f5dda6abd39c24334ef7703800bab0d23490139ed6b15828e", "ja": "わ、私は、『オレンジジャスミン』です……\nつけていると、ホッとするんですよ……♪", "zh": "我、我的是『柳橙茉莉』……\n涂上去能让人很放松呢……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1051_016tsu", "source_sha256": "cbad80b2d1eaf41dfb9251554164e46b3de7dff8b6158aa28f598b13fc7bee0c", "ja": "ねえねえ{$P$}さん。\n誰の香りのリップが一番人気だったの～？", "zh": "我问你喔，{$P$}先生。\n谁的香味护唇膏最受欢迎呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1052_p", "source_sha256": "57ffe67a88cb0d5f26ee484fe8e72ee95865857bd234d5168f6a668f9231e6d4", "ja": "うん。編集部でアンケートを取ったけど、\n3種類とも同じくらいの人気だったそうだ。", "zh": "嗯，编辑部有做问卷，\n三种的人气似乎都差不多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1053_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5907afcdf3abd7cd61f5edb2e6021d67688b0abed3ac98b63f6ee17508115441", "ja": "なーんだ！\n絶対、わたしが一番だと思ったのにな～。", "zh": "什么嘛──！\n我还以为一定是我的最多人喜欢呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1054_045kar", "source_sha256": "62412a3e80b5121bd68e35d45ac8b277075f513c1234c1d48859095ead7f7702", "ja": "わ、私はうれしいです。\n読者のみなさんにも、よろこんでもらえて、よかった。", "zh": "我、我觉得很开心，\n能获得读者们的肯定，真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1056_016tsu", "source_sha256": "40d435cf6a599fa408a82002bdd50257848c609a9f53fd6c7199660112708a45", "ja": "あ、ねえねえ♪　今日の写真もSNSに上げませんか？\nかわいく自撮りして！", "zh": "啊，欸欸♪要不要也把今天的照片上传SNS呢？\n我们拍张可爱的自拍吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1057_023aka", "source_sha256": "9a877d93843fe1b4e203b043561e2fcdfcdc72fb09f8ba7adc0298663fb04926", "ja": "賛成～！　華麗なる茜ちゃんジャンプの\n瞬間を撮ってもいいよ、翼ちゃん！", "zh": "赞成～！你可以拍下小茜华丽跳跃的瞬间喔，\n小翼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1058_045kar", "source_sha256": "6e781632b07a1750d2bb6b7d97388abadd90b441387009c9e91dbc34f5f43925", "ja": "わ、私も、写真に入っていいですか……？\n……ひゃっ！", "zh": "我、我也可以一起合照吗……？\n……呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1060_p", "source_sha256": "55142dff0ad6fa3d1754c517f7f88f8ec8470c73c9a43bfcbc0f37b8ebd19bfa", "ja": "か、可憐！　……よし、俺は写真に映らないように\nかがんでるから、俺につかまって……！", "zh": "可、可怜！好，我蹲下来躲开镜头，\n你就抓住我吧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1061_045kar", "source_sha256": "c54707c77dbbe19676723ae45382eb147765003bdecbca2f87a99234ada46a00", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\nす、すみません……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n麻、麻烦你了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1062_p", "source_sha256": "1bd0da75af0f4cf49386238ed6dd269264cd164299451b9c6989b5febdb36722", "ja": "（3人は楽しそうに写真を撮って、SNSに載せた。\nすぐに、同世代の女の子達の反応が返ってくる）", "zh": "（三人开心地拍了照片，并上传到SNS。\n与她们年龄相仿的女孩们马上就有了回应。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_07_1063_p", "source_sha256": "d03861a02f91ac1a7918202fc38c3c41305931607baa66c483b5eaba7027b221", "ja": "（劇場のファン層も、どんどん広がっていくだろう。\nアイドル達の可能性には、驚かされてばかりだな！）", "zh": "（往后剧场的粉丝客层还会继续扩展下去吧。\n偶像们隐藏的可能性总是如此令人惊讶！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
